# MEDOC API Tests (REST Client)

## Base URL
- Development: `http://localhost:3000/api/v1`
- Production: `https://medoc.example.com/api/v1`

---

## Authentication

### User Registration
```http
POST /auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!",
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe"
}
```

**Response (201):**
```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "code": 201,
  "message": "User registered successfully",
  "data": {
    "user": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "email": "user@example.com",
      "firstName": "John",
      "lastName": "Doe",
      "role": "user"
    },
    "tokens": {
      "accessToken": "jwt_token_here",
      "refreshToken": "jwt_refresh_token_here"
    }
  },
  "timestamp": "2025-12-17T10:30:00Z"
}
```

### User Login
```http
POST /auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!"
}
```

---

## Search (Public)

### Search Medications → Pharmacies
```http
GET /search?medication=Aspirin
```

**Response (200):**
```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "code": 200,
  "message": "Search results",
  "data": {
    "medication": {
      "id": "med_uuid",
      "name": "Aspirin",
      "genericName": "Acetylsalicylic Acid",
      "form": "Comprimé",
      "dosage": "500mg",
      "manufacturer": "Bayer"
    },
    "pharmacies": [
      {
        "id": "pharm_uuid",
        "name": "Pharmacie Centrale",
        "address": "123 Rue de la Paix",
        "city": "Paris",
        "latitude": 48.8566,
        "longitude": 2.3522,
        "isAvailable": true,
        "averageRating": 4.5
      }
    ]
  },
  "timestamp": "2025-12-17T10:30:00Z"
}
```

### Get Pharmacy Public Info
```http
GET /search/pharmacy/pharm_uuid
```

---

## Medications Management (Admin)

### Create Medication
```http
POST /medications
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your_jwt_token

{
  "name": "Ibuprofen",
  "genericName": "Ibuprofen",
  "form": "Comprimé",
  "dosage": "200mg",
  "manufacturer": "Sanofi"
}
```

### List All Medications
```http
GET /medications
```

### Get Single Medication
```http
GET /medications/med_uuid
```

### Update Medication
```http
PUT /medications/med_uuid
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your_jwt_token

{
  "dosage": "400mg"
}
```

### Delete Medication
```http
DELETE /medications/med_uuid
Authorization: Bearer your_jwt_token
```

---

## Pharmacy Management (Admin Controlled)

### Create Pharmacy (Admin Only)
```http
POST /pharmacies
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer admin_jwt_token

{
  "name": "Pharmacie Centrale Plus",
  "email": "contact@pharmacie-centrale.fr",
  "password": "SecurePass123!",
  "address": {
    "street": "456 Rue de la Santé",
    "city": "Lyon",
    "zipCode": "69000",
    "country": "France"
  },
  "location": {
    "latitude": 45.7640,
    "longitude": 4.8357
  },
  "phone": "0472123456"
}
```

### List Validated Pharmacies (Public)
```http
GET /pharmacies
```

### Get Pharmacy Details (Public)
```http
GET /pharmacies/pharm_uuid
```

### Validate Pharmacy (Admin Only)
```http
POST /pharmacies/pharm_uuid/validate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer admin_jwt_token

{
  "isValidated": true
}
```

### Update Pharmacy (Pharmacy or Admin)
```http
PUT /pharmacies/pharm_uuid
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer pharmacy_jwt_token

{
  "phone": "0472654321"
}
```

### Delete Pharmacy (Admin Only)
```http
DELETE /pharmacies/pharm_uuid
Authorization: Bearer admin_jwt_token
```

---

## Error Responses

### Bad Request (400)
```json
{
  "status": "error",
  "code": 400,
  "message": "Invalid input",
  "errors": {
    "email": ["Invalid email format"],
    "password": ["Password must be at least 8 characters"]
  },
  "timestamp": "2025-12-17T10:30:00Z"
}
```

### Unauthorized (401)
```json
{
  "status": "error",
  "code": 401,
  "message": "Authentication required",
  "timestamp": "2025-12-17T10:30:00Z"
}
```

### Forbidden (403)
```json
{
  "status": "error",
  "code": 403,
  "message": "Insufficient permissions",
  "timestamp": "2025-12-17T10:30:00Z"
}
```

### Not Found (404)
```json
{
  "status": "error",
  "code": 404,
  "message": "Medication not found",
  "timestamp": "2025-12-17T10:30:00Z"
}
```

### Conflict (409)
```json
{
  "status": "error",
  "code": 409,
  "message": "A pharmacy with this email already exists",
  "timestamp": "2025-12-17T10:30:00Z"
}
```

### Server Error (500)
```json
{
  "status": "error",
  "code": 500,
  "message": "An unexpected error occurred",
  "timestamp": "2025-12-17T10:30:00Z"
}
```

---

## Tips for Testing

1. **VS Code REST Client**: Install "REST Client" extension and use these snippets directly
2. **Postman**: Import this file or manually create requests
3. **cURL**: Convert to cURL using REST Client or Postman
4. **Authorization**: Add JWT token to `Authorization: Bearer token` header
